{"schema_version":1,"id":"y3_spring_greenhouse_light_dialogue","title":"溫室裡的光","start_node":"start","characters":["hero","yuna"],"nodes":[{"id":"start","type":"line","speaker":"yuna","text":"溫室讓作物不必害怕換季，親密的人也能讓彼此保留自己的季節。把農場擴到八級，也別忘了那顆陪你走來的心。","next":"answer"},{"id":"answer","type":"choice","options":[{"text":"我要守住土地，也守住承諾。","next":"accept"},{"text":"有些話我還沒說出口。","next":"later"}]},{"id":"accept","type":"action","actions":[{"type":"quest","quest_id":"y3_spring_greenhouse_light_quest","state":"active"}],"next":"end"},{"id":"later","type":"line","speaker":"yuna","text":"真正的承諾不會因晚一日開口而枯萎。","next":"end"},{"id":"end","type":"end"}]}
